# Competitive Benchmarking

# Research Item 1404

Source Type:
Competitive Benchmark

Source:
Microsoft Copilot

Topic:
Work Surface Integration

Observation:
Modern AI assistants increasingly combine conversational interaction with document, application, or workspace experiences.

Translation to Enterprise Experiences:

Users begin in conversation and transition into execution environments.

Key Takeaway:

AI should use the most appropriate surface for the task instead of forcing all interactions into chat.

Confidence:
High

Sources:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/guidance/responsible-ai

