# Research Item 1405

Source Type:
Competitive Benchmark

Source:
Microsoft Copilot

Topic:
Review Before Execution

Observation:
Users are more comfortable approving AI-generated changes when those changes are presented in a reviewable work surface.

Translation to Enterprise Experiences:

Examples:

- User creation
- License assignment
- Renewals
- Configuration changes

should be reviewed before execution.

Key Takeaway:

Canvas should function as a review layer before significant actions occur.

Confidence:
High

Sources:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/guidance/responsible-ai

